---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout active="about" title="About — Daily Dad Joke">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>About Daily Dad Joke</h1>
      <p>The internet's most reliable source of secondhand embarrassment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Every morning, Daily Dad Joke serves exactly one joke. Not two. Not a feed.
      One. Because a dad joke, like a strong cup of coffee, is best taken in a
      single, slightly painful dose.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our jokes are 100% family-friendly, rigorously groan-tested, and certified
      by a panel of dads who nodded slowly and said "that's a good one" without
      smiling.
    </p>
    <p>
      If a joke made you exhale slightly harder through your nose, our work here
      is done. If it made you groan out loud — even better. That's how you know
      it worked.
    </p>
    <p class="sig">— The Daily Dad Joke team ✳</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
